isis, that unfolds as part of a bigger plan to undermine European security."},{"language":"fi-FI","overview":"Suomen itsenäisyyspäivän juhlavastaanotto keskeytyy tylysti, kun presidentinlinnaan hyökätään ja valtionjohto otetaan panttivangiksi.  Suojelupoliisin Max Tanner määrätään neuvottelijaksi panttivankikriisiin, jonka taustalta löytyy terrori-iskuksi naamioitu suunnitelma Euroopan turvallisuuden horjuttamiseksi. Tannerin on neuvoteltava panttivankien hengestä ja selvitettävä kuka on iskun takana. Panoksena on ihmishenkien lisäksi koko Eurooppaa uhkaava turvallisuuspoliittinen kaaos."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vY6McfTQRWTMMNyjPQr8adKEYZH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zbCHHKDap6HoALl0evOTaxwRvQx.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":655302,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fi-FI","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vY6McfTQRWTMMNyjPQr8adKEYZH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vY6McfTQRWTMMNyjPQr8adKEYZH.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vY6McfTQRWTMMNyjPQr8adKEYZH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vY6McfTQRWTMMNyjPQr8adKEYZH.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Qf11JrAS1Qt5HhhQdBMAETiJzS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Qf11JrAS1Qt5HhhQdBMAETiJzS.jpg","language":"en","width":1175,"height":1763},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3Qf11JrAS1Qt5HhhQdBMAETiJzS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3Qf11JrAS1Qt5HhhQdBMAETiJzS.jpg","language":"en","width":1175,"height":1763},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/l